         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Quality your customers can verify, not just your sales team can claim.</h2>\n<p>Customers are more skeptical of supplement claims than ever, and they should be. The brands that earn trust are the ones whose quality is verifiable: certified facilities, third-party testing, transparent sourcing, and certificates of analysis available on request.</p>\n<p>Here is how we make sure every private label product we provide&nbsp;earns that trust on day one.</p>",
